    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The enforcement apparatus wielding policy levers executed a blunt-force deterrence spectacle, catching thousands in the gears of a policy machine. Data interpreters, spinning numbers to fit a storyline, highlighted the increase in apprehensions—a border activity metric from 6,598 to 8,268 in a single month. This narrative weaves a tale of low crossing numbers, a stated policy outcome metric, yet architects stalling the system's next pivot signal the funding dispute continues to block progress.",
